    // -- 3. Dead-space flip: a class-1 item (s > C/2) crumbing a bin down to
    //      < C/20 that even the lookahead item cannot use. Preserve the large
    //      residual and prefer the fresh bin instead (self-calibrating: the
    //      flip only wins when C - item_size is itself small). --
